{"title":"Cutthroats Hone","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Bandit</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>What it’s for</h2><p>A <b>gear-line reagent</b>. Each <b>quality reroll</b> of <b>daggers</b> uses one.</p><p><b>Dropped by</b> <b>Bandit</b>: <a href=\"#/monster/footpad\">Footpad</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/bandit\">Bandit</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/brigand\">Brigand</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/cutthroat\">Cutthroat</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/highwayman\">Highwayman</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/sellsword\">Sellsword</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/reaver\">Reaver</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/enforcer\">Enforcer</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain\">Outlaw Captain</a>, about 1 kill in 500 (an elite 1 in 50).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging &amp; reagents</a> for the odds and fees, and <a href=\"#/guide/reagents\">Reagents</a> for every reagent.</p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bandit\" title=\"Bandit - dropped it in 1 of 130 looted corpses (1/130)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0d647be846757b58c574.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/130<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"cutthroats-hone\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/6736597c0267feec13ad.svg\" alt=\"Cutthroats Hone\"></div><h3>Cutthroats Hone</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>1 monster</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/16/2026, 6:48:21 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}